GroqClient.parseReply by reflection — what each realistic model output becomes
parseReply is private (GroqClient.kt:115); the transport call in the same class wraps it in
a try/catch that returns the fallback ConverseResponse("Sorry, I didn't catch that.", None)
only when the JSONObject constructor or a getter throws; parseReply has its own catch for that.

model 'command' value -> RobotCommand (GroqClient.kt:119-127) -> what MainActivity does
(MainActivity.kt:293-353) -> the frame the transmit loop sends for it

exact JSON, turn_left                                -> command=Turn(direction=left)         frame=c0,0         acted on: command="STOP"; desired=PIVOT_LEFT
exact JSON, turn_right                               -> command=Turn(direction=right)        frame=c0,0         acted on: command="STOP"; desired=PIVOT_RIGHT; avoidanceActive=true (depth layer pivots)
fenced in ```json                                    -> command=com.example.guidedogtest.voice.RobotCommand$None@5c669da8 frame=c0,0         safe fallback
leading prose then JSON                              -> command=com.example.guidedogtest.voice.RobotCommand$None@5c669da8 frame=c0,0         safe fallback
missing command key                                  -> command=com.example.guidedogtest.voice.RobotCommand$None@5c669da8 frame=c0,0         silent no-op
unknown command 'Turn'                               -> command=com.example.guidedogtest.voice.RobotCommand$None@5c669da8 frame=c0,0         silent no-op
unknown command 'TURN_LEFT'                          -> command=com.example.guidedogtest.voice.RobotCommand$None@5c669da8 frame=c0,0         silent no-op
navigate without destination                         -> command=Navigate(destination=)       frame=c0,0         acted on: no-op here; the route arrives via voiceRoute -> adoptRoute()
navigate with destination                            -> command=Navigate(destination=the library) frame=c0,0         acted on: no-op here; the route arrives via voiceRoute -> adoptRoute()
command from the system prompt vocabulary 'go'       -> command=com.example.guidedogtest.voice.RobotCommand$Go@1d483de4 frame=c0,0         acted on: following=true + avoidanceActive=true (needs follower != null and a link)
backward (understood so it can be refused)           -> command=com.example.guidedogtest.voice.RobotCommand$Backward@4032d386 frame=c0,0         acted on: halt() + spoken refusal: only the forward corridor is measured
empty body                                           -> command=com.example.guidedogtest.voice.RobotCommand$None@5c669da8 frame=c0,0         safe fallback
error body (HTML)                                    -> command=com.example.guidedogtest.voice.RobotCommand$None@5c669da8 frame=c0,0         safe fallback
truncated JSON                                       -> command=com.example.guidedogtest.voice.RobotCommand$None@5c669da8 frame=c0,0         safe fallback
null JSON literal                                    -> command=com.example.guidedogtest.voice.RobotCommand$None@5c669da8 frame=c0,0         safe fallback

